# Bare `node_modules` matches only the root entry, so nested installs such as
# app/node_modules were being copied into the build context and then into the
# image by `COPY . .`. Deps come from the deps stage; never from the host.
**/node_modules
.nuxt
.output
.git
*.log

# Throwaway local artifacts — never belong in an image.
tree.txt
schema-dump.txt
mkadmin.js
COMMERCIAL-AUDIT.md
